Artifacts in GitHub Actions

Today I learned how artifacts are used to store and share files generated during workflow runs.

🔹 Upload Artifacts
Artifacts can store:
Build outputs
Test reports
Logs
They are uploaded at the end of a job.

🔹 Download Artifacts
Artifacts can be downloaded:
In later jobs
After workflow completion
For debugging or review
This enables data sharing across jobs.

🔹 Use Cases in Pipelines
Artifacts are useful for:
Passing build results
Storing test evidence
Debugging failed runs
They improve CI/CD visibility.

🔥 3-Line Takeaway
Artifacts store outputs.
 Jobs share results.
 Pipelines gain traceability.
